1
00:00:00,849 --> 00:00:02,749
(Leonard:)Sheldon.

2
00:00:02,751 --> 00:00:06,521
I didn't say "fun" fact.
I'm not a monster.

3
00:00:06,521 --> 00:00:08,491
(Bernadette:)He's gonna be okay.

4
00:00:08,490 --> 00:00:09,360
(all sighing)

5
00:00:09,358 --> 00:00:12,158
(Sheldon:)Now it's a fun fact.

6
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:15,600
(Stuart:)Boy, stuff like this really
puts things in perspective.

7
00:00:15,597 --> 00:00:17,297
(Penny:)Why are you
dressed like that?

8
00:00:17,299 --> 00:00:20,199
(Stuart:)Oh, uh, Howard thought
it'd be funny

9
00:00:20,202 --> 00:00:22,232
(Stuart:)to tell me
it was a costume party.

10
00:00:22,237 --> 00:00:23,767
(Bernadette:)That wasn't nice.

11
00:00:23,772 --> 00:00:27,612
(Stuart:)No, but he almost died,
so we're cool.

12
00:00:28,944 --> 00:00:32,174
(Raj:)You know, if you think about it,
tonight was kind of like

13
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:34,280
(Raj:)a real-life
Game of Thrones.

14
00:00:34,283 --> 00:00:35,283
(Amy:)How?

15
00:00:35,284 --> 00:00:37,614
(Raj:)Well, Howard eating
that pistachio

16
00:00:37,619 --> 00:00:39,789
(Raj:)was like when King
Joffrey got poisoned.

17
00:00:39,788 --> 00:00:42,218
(Penny:)Okay, well, that was murder,
this was an accident.

18
00:00:42,224 --> 00:00:43,194
(Raj:)Okay.

19
00:00:43,191 --> 00:00:45,521
(Raj:)But you using Sheldon

20
00:00:45,527 --> 00:00:48,557
(Raj:)to do your dirty work
is like when Cersei

21
00:00:48,563 --> 00:00:50,293
(Raj:)used the King's Guard
to do her bidding.

22
00:00:50,299 --> 00:00:53,599
(Sheldon:)Cersei uses her body
to manipulate men.

23
00:00:53,602 --> 00:00:56,372
(Sheldon:)Penny just takes me
to The LEGO Store.

24
00:00:56,371 --> 00:00:59,811
(Raj:)Okay. Oh, how about this?

